<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43465" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sēmĭ-dĕus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>half-divine</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">heroes,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the Argonauts</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 5, 373</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">called also, reges,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 518</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Acnill. 2, 363</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">parentes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Th. 9, 376</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Manes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc. 9,
					7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">canes,</span>”
				i. e. <i>Anubis</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					832</span></i>
			 (al. semicanes dei): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Dryades,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. H.
					4, 49</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nymphae semideumque genus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Ib.
					82</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Silvanus arbiter umbrae Semideumque pecus,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the Pans</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 6, 112</span></i>
			.— Hence, <i>subst.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sēmĭ-dĕus</span></b> ,
			i, m., <i>a demigod</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">semideique deique,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 14, 673</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">1, 192</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sēmĭ-dĕa</span></b> ,
			ae, f., <i>a
			demigoddess</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tres volucres, tres semideae, tres semipuellae,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the Sirens</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Idyll. 11, 21</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
